window.products.push({"id":1146259,"name":"Marwood Sofa Slipcover Reversible Chair Sofa Cover, Water Resistant Small Couch Cover Quilted Furniture Protector with Elastic Straps for Pets Kids Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ngvxHmivL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DIMENSIONS: This reversible sofa cover fits seat width 24 inch (Chair), please see MEASURING GUIDE in photos before purchasing. 5 Solid colors provided make the couch slipcover easier to coordinate with your room decoration. Chemicals free and ECO friendly, high safety to kids and pets. WATER RESISTANT: Made of high quality microfiber, very stretchable, anti-grab, water resistant, breathable wear-resistance and soft. Our pet covers for couches and sofas has super water-resistant performance to protect your sofa from stains, baby’s poo poo, pet hair or any possible mess and accidents. No fading and no scent, great choice for homes with children and pets. REVERSIBLE DESIGN: Versatile chair cover is fully reversible. Reversible colors will also save your cost, like get 2 sets of sofa protector cover while only pay 1 set. It also transforms an old, worn out couch into the stunning centerpiece of your room. This beautiful quilted sofa slipcover is suitable for various styles of furniture, make your room more exquisite and elegance. STAY IN PLACE: Super easy to use and install, MARWOOD furniture couch cover adopts fixed straps design, with adjustable loose straps and metal hooks for fixing the sofa, strong and long-lasting, fits most types of sofa(not recommended to be used on leather). The extended armrest part and 2 customized foams of this sofa cushions cover will stay your sofa in place further. EASY CARE: This pet couch protector should be washed in cold water(under 30℃). Different colors should be washed separately. Mild detergent, no bleaching, low-temperature ironing is recommended. CUSTOMER SERVICE: 7x24 hours customer mail service. We think you're going to love this couch seat cover as much as we do. Please message us if it is unusable due to manufacturing defects, we will definitely give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ngvxHmivL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marwood","source_asin":"B09G9R9QSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9R9QSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9R9QSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
