window.products.push({"id":1146261,"name":"Salamander Designs Chameleon Collection Sonoma 237 - American Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3099.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-h5ADSZIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sonoma, a mission-influenced style, has doors that contrast vertical wooden strips with black, micro-perforated metal inserts. Its American Cherry tone and relaxed look work especially well in transitional rooms. From the Manufacturer Why You Need Salamander Chameleon Audio/Video Furniture Furniture designed for audio and video components is important because it incorporates features that improve the performance of your home theater system. Traditional furniture manufacturers do not take into consideration important aspects such as Ventilation, infrared passthrough for remote controls, and removable rear panels for component access, wire management and media storage. The Chameleon series by Salamander Designs is a modern storage system for todays home theater. Its innovative and award-winning design provides unparalleled flexibility with the design of tailored furniture systems. A full line of refined elements and accessories allows owners to fine-tune individual systems to keep pace with their growing requirements. A delicate balance of high-quality materials gives Chameleon distinct form and function. Extruded aluminum posts provide the aesthetic and functional backbone, and the oversized hardwood shelves enhance its bold and beautiful appeal. An elegantly simple design is advanced by thoughtful details, such as optional flat-panel TV mounts, choice between caster wheels and designer cabinet feet, and easily-removable rear panels. Inside Salamander's Chameleon Series Salamander Design's newly released Chameleon series will change your view of entertainment furniture. The Sonoma, one of the four available Chameleon designs, is influenced by the popular Arts and Crafts Mission style. A compelling appearance meets strong support for TVs and other entertainment platforms. Sonoma has doors that contrast vertical wooden strips with black, micro-perforated metal inserts. Its American Cherry tone and relaxed look work especially well in transitional rooms such as family rooms, recreational rooms and enclosed patio rooms--anywhere you want to entertain in style and comfort. The Sonoma series complements a traditional or rustic decor(Sonoma 221 cabinet shown) Sonoma's Quality Features This A/V cabinet comes with twin- and triple-rack options with two or three cabinet doors depending on the model number (see below for various model numbers and sizes). All of the Chameleon series A/V cabinets are 21.25 inches deep and are between 44 and 65 inches long that allow you to fit them into any room in your home. It has two interior height-adjustable shelves within all of the different sizes of the Salamander Design's Chameleon series to fit your entertainment needs - from DVD players to stereo systems to gaming consoles.  It has a rock-solid framework and a gorgeous, clean look. The 'smart' and rigid aluminum frame comfortably supports the all solid wood doors that close and open with soft-close dampeners. Cooling air flow is never a problem with ventilation louvers built right into cabinet bottoms and 'pinch-out' easily removable rear panels allow for easy access for rearranging A/V hardware and wires whenever the need arises. Salamander Design's Chameleon Series Contains a 'Smart' Aluminum Skeleton Salamander Design's Chameleon series has a 'smart' aluminum skeleton. This rock-solid framework securely holds an array of high performance accessories while hiding them from view. The Chameleon series is rich with structural features that benefit from this hidden framework. From the ability to switch between different styles of footing - wheels or feet in wood or metal to add accessories like an IR repeater or cooling kit directly to the A/V cabinet frame without loss of structural integrity while holding all of your entertainment hardware. Optional Accessories Make Chameleon Adapt to Your Living Space Cooling Kits enhance the air flow in your Chameleon. The Salamander Chameleon Active Cooling Kit uses thermostatically controlled fans to keep gear running cool. It replaces the rear cabinet panel of your Chameleon cabinet. Easy to install, the Active Cooling Kit replaces the standard rear panel of your Chameleon AV cabinet. Two integrated, thermostatically controlled fans regulate cabinet temperature. Please note the TV Mount cannot be used in conjunction with cooling fan kits on any Twin styles. Flat Panel Mounts allow you to mount your TV to your Chameleon. Salamander Design's Chameleon TV cabinets have clean styling that looks great with today's flat panel displays. The Chameleon universal mounting system for flat panel TVs attaches securely to your Chameleon cabinet. It easily supports the majority of today's large flat-panel TVs from 32-inches to 60-inches. The TV mount offers seven inches of height and angle adjustment. The built-in cable manager helps keep cords out of sight. Please note the TV Mount cannot be used in conjunction with cooling fan kits on any Twin styles. The IR Repeater does not inte","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-h5ADSZIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Salamander Designs","source_asin":"B00I3AQGWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3AQGWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3AQGWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
