window.products.push({"id":1146447,"name":"Handy Living Madison Squared Arm Microfiber Sofa, Crimson Red With 2 Decorative Wine Striped Throw Pillows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W5MyRkZaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features a modern squared arm design in a vibrant crimson red microfiber. Includes two 18” bold striped accent pillows with wine, gold, fuchsia, orange and a hint of lime green (100-percent Cotton). Espresso finished wooden legs. Covered in a durable, stain resistant 100-percent polyester red microfiber that works well in any room environment. Polyester fiber fill back cushions ensure total comfort. Polyester fiber, foam and pocket coils in seat cushions offer durable firm seating surfaces that eases with usage. Powder coated steel seat and back frame reinforced with metal-to-metal connections for strength and durability. Steel stretcher from front to back for extra strength and sturdiness. Gone are the days of wondering will it make it? Innovative engineering and design enables this sofa to fit through a 10 inch opening and be assembled in the actual room. Eco-friendly and efficient product design uses less fossil fuel based components in construction and delivery. Break it back down to recycle at the end of use for additional piece of mind. Each sofa ships in one (1) box. Assembly required. Tools and instructions included. Takes less than an hour to assemble.. Welcome to Handy Living: Your kind of furniture. Right. Now. Their goal is simple: put full size upholstered furniture in a single box that will ship via common carrier to every doorstep. Handy Living has made everyday furniture exciting and different. They believe furniture should be stylish and fun. It should be affordable. It should be easy to deliver quickly and conveniently in a single box - and ridiculously easy to assemble. And it should be environmentally responsible. Handy Living - Thinking Inside the Box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W5MyRkZaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handy Living","source_asin":"B004XFX1JA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004XFX1JA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004XFX1JA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1146448,"name":"Q Squared Diamond White BPA-Free Melamine Dinner Plate, 10-1/2 Inches, Set of 4, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yUMlKWxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shake up your dining experience with Q Squared! The Q Squared Diamond White Collection is a sophisticated series defined by simple yet strong silhouettes. Crafted from hospitality-grade, man-made resin, the Diamond White Collection features a superior class of melamine that looks and feels like stoneware. Q Squared melamine is BPA-free, shatterproof, chip-resistant, and guaranteed to withstand a lifetime of dishwasher runs while maintaining its exceptional quality and luster. Refined and resilient, the Q Squared Diamond White Collection is an enchanting, all-season addition to indoor and outdoor events, casual dining experiences, special occasions, and everyday meals. Each Diamond White Dinner Plate measures 10-1/2-inches long by 10-1/2-inches wide and comes in a set of four (4). Founded by mother-daughter team Nancy and Alaina, Q Squared was created to counter overpriced, under-designed dinnerware. Their premium-quality products seamlessly blend beauty and accessibility, upgrading every day utensils with ornate, one-of a-kind patterns. Since its debut in the United States, Q Squared has blossomed beyond the kitchen to reinvigorate every room in the house. Chase the unexpected: choose Q Squared.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yUMlKWxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Q Squared","source_asin":"B01F29VOL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F29VOL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F29VOL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
