window.products.push({"id":1146627,"name":"WRIGHTMART Handmade Acacia Hardwood Coat Rack with 4 Hooks, Durable Rustic Wall Mount, Versatile Hanger for Entryway, Bedroom, Bathroom, Farmhouse Boh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719s2y0AP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acacia Wood Natural Wall Mounted Coat Rack: A beautiful and functional addition to any space, providing both style and practicality. Durability: Acacia hardwood is known for its strength and durability, which means that your coat rack will last for years to come. Unlike other materials like soft woods and faux woods like MDF, hardwood can withstand the weight of heavy coats and jackets without bending or breaking. Style: Hardwood coat racks have a timeless and elegant look that can complement any decor style, from modern to traditional. They add warmth and character to a room, and the natural beauty of the wood grain makes them a statement piece. Eco-Friendly: Natural hardwood is a sustainable material that is environmentally friendly. Unlike other materials that require a lot of energy and resources to produce, hardwood is a renewable resource that can be harvested and replanted without harming the environment. Versatility: Wall mounted coat racks take up very little space and can be installed in any room of your home or office. They are perfect for small spaces like entryways or mudrooms, and can also be used in bedrooms, bathrooms, or closets to organize scarves, hats, towels, and bags. Organization: A wall mounted coat rack keeps your outerwear organized and off the floor, making it easier to find your coat when you are running out the door. It also prevents your coats and jackets from getting wrinkled or damaged from being piled on a chair or bed. Dimensions & Carton Contents: 1 18” Coat Rack, 4 large double hanger hooks; Includes Mounting Hardware; 2 screws and 2 anchors. 18” x 5” X 3” (Handmade size may vary slightly).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719s2y0AP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WRIGHTMART","source_asin":"B0B6WCT7MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6WCT7MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6WCT7MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
