window.products.push({"id":1146696,"name":"Food Scale Digital Kitchen Scale Digital Food Kitchen Scale Food Scales Digital weight grams and oz Cooking Scale Tare Function 5kg 0.05oz 1g Multifun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81--hIzI1fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifetime Warranty:We believe in our food scale. We value our reputation as an expert on kitchen scales. That's why we back all our digital food scales with lifetime warranty and provide our digital kitchen scalewith friendly, easy-to-reach support.The digital food kitchen scale is 100% lifetime quality assurance. Super Easy: Food scale uses a smooth stainless steel platform, which is Easy to Clean; kitchen scale uses fingerprint proof technology, which is Easy to Maintain; The perfect and simple design of this digital food scalemakes it Easy to Use and Easy to Read. The petite design makes the digital kitchen food scale Easy to Store. 4 High Precision Different Units: This food scale is the perfect addition to your kitchen. This kitchen scale features 4 different units of measurements. In addition to the most basic food scales digital weight, grams, and oz, it also includes lb and fluid ml. If you want more consistent results frombaking, cooking, or coffee brewing, you should consider getting our digital food scale. For weighing small amounts very precisely,,you'll want to invest in a digital kitchen scale. Tare Function: This digital kitchen scale makes sure you are measuring your food, not the container. This digital food scale can quickly show a gradual increase in weight when you're measuring; this kitchen scale allows you to know when to stop adding an ingredient. Food scale automatically locks its readout; digital food kitchen scale automatically switches off when not in use, which makes it low power consumption; digital kitchen food scale is ideal for almost all food Wide range of applications: This digital kitchen scale is a kid's favorite kitchen toy, The food scale switches off after 2 minutes of inactivity, so if you forget to turn the digital food scale off or if your hands are all gooey with food and you cannot turn off the digital kitchen scale, it will automatically switch off.This food scales digital weight, grams, and ozis has pleasing functions; this kitchen scale ensures you a satisfactory experience, healthy life style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81--hIzI1fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"instecho","source_asin":"B07D2ZNM2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2ZNM2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2ZNM2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
