window.products.push({"id":1146754,"name":"Cube Vacuum Storage Bags, 8 Pack(4 Jumbo+ 4 Large) Space Saver Bags with Hand Pump, Vacuum Compression Sealer Storage Bags for Clothes, Mattress, Blan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nx1V1seHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Cube Vacuum Storage Bags】These 8pack vacuum storage bags are designed with cube size, which is of larger capacity and can store more out-of-season clothing or bedding than other's flat bags.They comes with 8 pack vacuum bags of 2 sizes, 4 jumbo and 4 large, are ideal for moving or storing many different items,like your comforters, sheets, blankets, duvets, towels, and more! A great balance to help you save up to 80% more space and keep your clothes airtight, fresh and protected ! 【Two Ways to Compress The Bags】Our vacuum bags has a 2-in-1 air valve, not only allows you to take the air out of the bags using the vacuum cleaner or the included hand pump, also enable you to compress the bags directly by your hand without using pump. And it is a cap-free air valve, which is totally different from other's bag, you don't need to take the cap on or off, just turn it to left to open before deflating, then turn it to right to close after deflating finished to keep an airtight seal 【A Hand Pump with Sealing Ring Included】 Our space saving bags comes with a fast and high efficiency hand pump. It has a larger size and a sealing ring, which enables the pump works faster and easier than other's normal hand pump. They are also compatible with the standard vacuum cleaner. Before using the hand pump, we suggest you to compress the bags with hands firstly to make most of the air out of bags, then it will be very easier for you to use the hand pump to make the air completely out 【No Leak and Airtight 】These cube vacuum bags are made with double-zipper closure and ultra-secure triple seal turbo valve which provides a secure seal and air-tight suction, they will ensure no air gets back into the vacuum sealing bags to ruin what's being stored. Definitely a Great and an Effective Protection Way to your items and protect it from somethings that would damage or even ruin your clothes or fabric 【Durable and Reusable】The bags are made with a high-quality mixture of PA&PE. It is a study, thicker and healthy material compared to other vacuum storage bags, It will retain their seal for a very, very long time, and hold up several uses of packing for storing, traveling or housing moving. And the PA&PE materials have no harm to human body. Also these bags are see-through on one side, you can easily spot what’s inside, find what you need without opening several bags","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nx1V1seHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z ZONAMA","source_asin":"B0BN8BPQBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN8BPQBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN8BPQBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
