window.products.push({"id":1146838,"name":"RELPOM® Slushie Maker Cup, TIK TOK Magic Quick Frozen Smoothies Cup, Cooling Cup, Double Layer Squeeze Slushy Maker Cup, Cool Stuff Birthday Gifts for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KGMvxVCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍧 [Instant Freeze Technology] Built-in freezing liquid, transform your favorite sugary drinks (such as cola and juice) into fresh slush in just a few minutes. The built-in freezing liquid and ingredients are exchanged for heat and cold to make it safe and hygienic. It will not lead to dilution of the original flavor because it not use a mixture of ice and juice to achieve a semi-frozen consistency. 🍦 [Food Grade Safe Material] - Made of BPA Free, food grade silicone, environmental protection and healthy. All parts are non-toxic. This Frozen Magic Slushy Maker is 100% safe for you and your children. The built-in condensate has a shelf life of 18 months, It’s washable and reusable, simply rinse the liner bag with running water(No Detergent), and refreeze. 🥤 [Easy to Use & Cool Gift] Just put the cup in the frozen layer of the refrigerator for 4~5 hours, then pour sugary drink, squeeze the cup body, it just takes 1~2 minutes to make the smoothies. You can make different kinds of smoothies, like juice or soda, or you can add milk to make a thick shake. Everyone can make smoothies at home. Excellent creative gift for lover, families, friends, coworkers, classmates and children. 🍹 [2 in 1 Straw and Spoon] Spoon connected to the straw can be used as a spoon or as a straw, meet different needs. 🎁 [DIY Healthy Smoothie] Pour any drink you like, like the juice or soda etc. and squeeze it. Just 2 minutes, you get smoothie. Don't buy limited muddy flavors in ice cream parlors. Use it to customize your own cold drink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KGMvxVCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RELPOM","source_asin":"B0C14GFZ1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C14GFZ1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C14GFZ1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
