window.products.push({"id":1146924,"name":"FITHOME Small Lunch Bag for Women & Men, Reusable Insulated Lunch Cooler Tote Bags, Leakproof Thermal Lunch Bag, Adult Durable Lunch Bag for Work","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818DnLdD4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Wide-Open Design】Fithome lunch bag is designed by our senior designer so it has been deeply loved by young people because of its unique appearance. Insulated lunch bag adopts an opening design, allowing you to easily put in/take out the lunch box, drink, and food. Two front pockets can be used as daily kit containers like keys and tissues. We have 4 different colors for women and men, it is suitable for any occasion like office/park/friends' home, etc. 【Thermal & Insulated】Insulated lunch bag can keep your food stay warm as well as your fruit stay fresh. We have designed three-layer, the outer layer of Oxford fabric is made of waterproof so it can protect the inside of the freezable lunch bag, the middle layer is thickened EPE foam so it has buffer protection, and the inner layer is made of leakproof 0.2mm PEVA lining (BPA Free). 【Waterproof & Leakproof】Because of the Oxford fabric's outer layer, it is waterproof so you can remove dirt easily and quickly. The inner layer can also be cleaned easily by wiping with a towel, moreover, the lunch bags are leakproof. If the soup or drinks pour out from the lunch container accidentally, don't worry because they won't leak out from our adult lunch bags. Take the broken container out from the lunch bag and clean it with a dry towel so you can use it again, it is convenient for adults. 【Lightweight & Portable】This lunch bag is lightweight and portable. The lunch bag looks small but with its large capacity, it could perfectly fit your lunchbox, snacks, and drinks. You can use it as a reusable lunch bag, or grocery bag. This stylish lunch box is suitable for a variety of occasions, including office, travel, and college. It is also suitable for all groups including women, men, and adults. 【Practical & Convenient】Lunch bag is 9.44 x 4.72 x 7.08 inches large, it easily holds your lunch boxes, fruits, snacks, canned drinks, and other foods you want. The design of the front pocket allows you to put the small objects you need in daily life, such as mobile phones, tissues, spoons, keys, wallets, etc., which is very practical and convenient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818DnLdD4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FITHOME","source_asin":"B0BQR4Y8P7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQR4Y8P7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQR4Y8P7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
