window.products.push({"id":1146960,"name":"Sass & Belle Follow Your Dreams Money Jar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ysOJiC75L._AC_.jpg","description":"Being told to follow your dreams is all very well but if you can't afford to do it then you have a predicament on your hands! Do not fear, we've created a money box which will ensure you save your pennies and gently work towards your dreams becoming a reality. Better yet, it comes in a beautiful design. Inspired by a jar repurposed, it has the phrase 'follow your dreams' printed on in black and gold with a scattering of stars. We adore the finishing touch of a jute string around the lid and a star charm attached. Remember, every time you pop a coin in the slot, you're following your dream!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ysOJiC75L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sass & Belle","source_asin":"B071P6XFCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071P6XFCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071P6XFCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1146961,"name":"Screwpull Trilogy Travel Corkscrew, Frosted Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qjz7DHHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve up favorite drinks in relaxed fashion with help from this sleek travel-style corkscrew. Ideal for sharing a bottle of wine while relaxing at the cabin, picnicking at the campground, or lounging seaside, the compact unit's Teflon-coated, double helix screw effortlessly removes even dry, brittle, and stubborn corks from standard or flange-top bottles. Furthermore, it utilizes patented Activ-Ball Plus technology to push the extracted cork back off the screw for foolproof collection or disposal--simply turn the handle in the reverse direction to release the cork unscathed, pinch down on the sides to keep the cork from falling off, and reinsert it with the same ease. The corkscrew's classic self-pulling design features a simple crank that sports a small opening for turning with just one finger--no more embarrassing hassles or fighting with unwieldy corks while guests await their drinks. Finally, its ergonomic design pairs a smooth, sculpted shape with soft-touch panels to ensure a comfortable and ergonomic grip, while its lever-style handle folds for compact storage or transport. Distinguished by its handsome finish, the travel-style corkscrew measures approximately 2 by 2-8/9 by 7-2/5 inches and carries a five-year limited warranty. Amazon.com Just as there's nothing better than a bottle of wine at the beach, cabin, or campground; theres nothing worse than being stuck without a corkscrew. The travel corkscrew from Screwpull is not only compact and lightweight; it's a sophisticated tool friends will covet. Not only does this clever corkscrew take the work out of cork removal for effortless bottle opening, it now automatically twists the cork off the screw as well. To open, simply pull the handle and the durable Teflon screw drives precisely into the cork's center. Push lightly the other way and the cork climbs effortlessly out of the bottle. Then, while holding the corkscrew panels (and not the cork); pull the handle again and--voila, the device pushes the cork off the screw unscathed! Pinch down on the sides to keep the cork from falling off, and reinsert it with the same ease. Finally, fold up the corkscrew and pack it away. Designed in Europe and engineered with the highest quality materials for strength and durability, Screwpull's new Trilogy line also features luxurious, soft touch panels for extra comfort. Non-stick coating and perfectly-shaped points ensure frictionless opening. Plus, this innovative new line of Trilogy corkscrews and bottle-opening accessories was awarded the 2004 Cooking Club of America Kitchen Tested Seal of Approval from Cooking Pleasures magazine. --Brian Olson","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qjz7DHHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Screwpull","source_asin":"B0006590AK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006590AK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006590AK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1146962,"name":"2Pcs Stainless Steel Mesh Colander Strainer Basket Drainer- Fine Mesh Strainer Rice Washing Bowl, Colander Sieve Sifters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CRjhi1bFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality】This upgrade fine mesh strainer is made of premium stainless steel and the thickness of mesh is increased. It won’t rust, corrode, bend or warp and stands up to both daily kitchen trifles and the rigors of a professional kitchen. 【Sturdy Base】Fully-perforated mesh strainer and footed design provide superior drainage with minimal loss. For faster preparation, a cleaner rinse, and more efficient cooking. 【Superior Design】Our strainer colander basket can rest in your pot, in the sink or on a countertop, so that your hands are free to you focus on other things. Our basket allows you to be more efficient in the kitchen, because you'll be able to cook faster, easier and with better results! It's easy to clean and dishwasher safe. 【Wildely Application】This stainless steel colander is a classic for cooking, salad washing and liquid straining. It features micro-perforated mesh that works great with a wide variety of food, like spaghetti, beans, tomatoes, potatoes, lettuce and fruit! 【Kitchen necessity 】A must have and necessary tool for prepping and cooking an assortment of foods and dishes. No seasoned or beginner chef should be left without one in their kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CRjhi1bFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sel Natural","source_asin":"B091H7RR7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091H7RR7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091H7RR7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
