window.products.push({"id":1146975,"name":"AirFree T800 Filterless Silent Air Purifier for Home I Requires No Filter, Fan, or Humidifier, Covers 180 sq ft - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mx-oAC+8L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"AIRFREE T 800 FILTERLESS AIR PURIFIER◆ FRESH AIR ◆Natural way for cleaning the oxygen in your house so you can breathe and live more comfortably. Airfree products provide the perfect combination of air sterilizers and germ killing deodorizers to sanitize. Remove unpleasant odors don't just mask them! ◆ MAINTENANCE FREE ◆Our low cost, maintenance free filtration system means you don't have to wear gloves, spray with soap or use a special sanitizing cleaning tool or brush to keep unit clean. There is no need to trouble with reusable or washable hepa filters or accessories. To clean dirt from tower, simply wipe away with cloth. It is that simple!◆ HIGH QUALITY ◆Airfree electric purifiers are made with professional construction in Europe with the latest antibacterial scientific technologies. Enjoy healthy, clean air and easier breathing. Works well in small and tiny spaces. If you are looking for a sanitizer or deodorizer for a large area, check out our other Airfree machines which are ideal for such spaces and vary in size, features and color (black or white).◆ EASY TO USE ◆No setup required. Simply plugs into outlet straight out of the box. Unit should be operated continuously for optimal cleaning power. Keep in open spot where air can flow freely. Place on the ground or higher such as a desk or shelf. Powered by air convection without the use of a noisy, loud fan. Molecules are destroyed at 400 F inside core. The purified air is cooled down and dissipated throughout the environment.◆ ODOR ELIMINATOR ◆Use as an air freshener to keep bad household smells, that can travel throughout houses, away! Great eliminator of mildew, dander from cats and dogs, dust mite and other airborne germs. Be on guard against pesky germs and odors. Airfree systems provide max prevention disinfection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mx-oAC+8L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airfree","source_asin":"B00L08IDT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1146975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L08IDT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L08IDT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
